{"id":"5530a9fdfb65f873","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-ultrafilter-extension.md","title":"ZFC Ultrafilter Extension","display":"df-zfc-ultrafilter-extension — ZFC Ultrafilter Extension","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ultrafilter-extension","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ultrafilter-extension"],"display":"df-zfc-ultrafilter-extension — ZFC Ultrafilter Extension","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ultrafilter-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ultrafilter-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ultrafilter-extension — ZFC Ultrafilter Extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" href=\"?note=5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md\">../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,F,U\\in V\">\\(X,F,U\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Filter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\)</span>（集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 上的滤子谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" href=\"?note=5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md\">../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\)</span>（集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 上的超滤子谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UltrafilterExtension}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{UltrafilterExtension}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（本原子定义的谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ultrafilter\\text{-}extension}\\vdash \\mathrm{UltrafilterExtension}_S(U,F,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Filter}_S(F,X)\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,X)\\land F\\subseteq U\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ultrafilter\\text{-}extension}\\vdash \\mathrm{UltrafilterExtension}_S(U,F,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Filter}_S(F,X)\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,X)\\land F\\subseteq U\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 都是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> 的子族；不能混用一般偏序集上的三参数滤子谓词。</li>\n<li>“每个真滤子可扩张为超滤子”是依赖选择原理的存在定理，不属于本定义本身。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"5a7d94a7a7f8209a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"5a7d94a7a7f8209a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Filter}_S$（集合 $X$ 上的滤子谓词，见 [[../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S$（集合 $X$ 上的超滤子谓词，见 [[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,F,U\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Filter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UltrafilterExtension}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ultrafilter\\text{-}extension}\\vdash \\mathrm{UltrafilterExtension}_S(U,F,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Filter}_S(F,X)\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,X)\\land F\\subseteq U","display":true},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(X)","display":false}],"bytes":1184,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3850","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-ultrafilter-extension.md|58-df-zfc-ultrafilter-extension]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5a7d94a7a7f8209a","5e8b8d97b21dd8e8"]}